\caption{By month}
\end{subfigure}
\caption{Within-week and within-year seasonality of open-day sales.}
\label{fig:season}
\end{figure}

Promotions and store format are the other two strong drivers
(Figure~\ref{fig:promotype}). Promotion days carry markedly higher average
sales, and Type~B stores stand apart from the rest.

